Window Taskbar (windowtaskbar@italian-brainrot.github.io)

This is a fork of "App Icons Taskbar" (aztaskbar) 31.4 by AndrewZaech
(https://gitlab.com/AndrewZaech/aztaskbar), GPL-3.0-or-later, from which
the panel, favourite-icon, drag-and-drop, preview and preferences code is
taken. The fork replaces the grouped running-app list with one button per
open window (each with its title) and adds the window-button preferences.

The upstream project is not affiliated with this fork. Any bug in this fork
is ours, not upstream's.
